i will walk the great spiral  and i will let the mother the maiden and  the crone decide what is true  who is right  and who is wrong  hey guys pete here i wasn't planning on  making another foundation video before  the recap for episode 7 and then i saw  all these new previews they put out in  the last few days this will be a quick  one but i just wanted to put something  together after seeing some of these  shots to see what other people think  might be going on in them there will be  potential spoilers for the rest of the  first season of foundation so if you're  not into that this is your chance to  leave before i get into the more  interesting stuff apple tv plus put out  two exclusive clips for the upcoming  episode 7 which isn't something i've  seen them do since the premiere i'll put  links to both of these in the  description so you can watch them in  full if you want to the first one was on  tvline.com and features brother day at  the salt palace trying to prove he has a  soul to the followers of the luminous  faith he says that he'll walk the great  spiral to let the goddesses decide what  is true who is right and who is wrong  it's his plan to go against halima so if  he completes this i guess he'll have  some credibility with the faithful the  second clip was on the rotten tomatoes  youtube channel and featured brother  dawn and azora and a backup brother dawn  in a tank as it were he's explaining to  her that he'll be destroyed and replaced  if his brothers find out he's different  which we can see is already starting to  happen which means he's in a pretty  rough spot this is the first we've seen  that they have backups and it looks like  his days may be numbered the final thing  that came out was on the apple tv  youtube channel it's called the saga  featurette and it's a mixture of stuff  we've already seen and some crazy  looking shots from the rest of the  season i'm just gonna go through this  and point out all the new stuff that we  haven't seen yet the first thing that  jumps out here is this completely  different looking ship swooping down on  terminus you can see the little flags on  the ground where people marked how close  they were able to get to the vault and  we see even more of this later so we'll  come back to it then we see salvor on a  ship i'm assuming this is the bridge of  the invictus considering the summary of  episode 7 which says the enactrions and  their hostages board the fabled warship  there's another shot of day in front of  the salt palace that looks like it's  connected to the spiral clip there's a  shot of hugo in the same place we saw  salvor on the invictus behind him we see  the anacryon soldier rowan who was with  pharah's group and then another  character in front of him who's dressed  differently someone we haven't seen  before and someone who doesn't look  particularly  that's followed by salvor wearing the  suit on a ship that could be hugo's the  one they left terminus on at the end of  the last episode or it could also be the  invictus then there's this shot of  gail's cryopod entering synaxis's  atmosphere which doesn't really add up  that's followed by another shot where we  see her inside the pod the reason it  doesn't add up is that we see another  shot of gail on the ship where we last  saw her and it looks like harry's  standing behind her and then there's  another quick shot of harry glitching  that looks like it picks up right where  we left them there's an unrelated shot  of day breaking some glass which is more  or less without context it looks like  this might be inside the palace which  you have to guess is taking place after  he returns from his trip he has his  house clothes on and that made me think  of this scene i saw yesterday when i was  editing my book to show video but i went  back and watched it and don't see the  exact same angle it's possible though  this might be brother day smashing the  glass to where they keep the original  cleon we see salvor outside in the suit  again and this is probably on the  invictus it looks like there's a gun  mounted behind her and she's screaming  about something that she's watching and  then we see that there's a battle going  on she sort of rolls to the ground to  avoid getting shot this probably follows  this other shot where we see her in the  suit approaching the invictus which is  similar to what we saw in the trailer  before the season came out and there's  one last shot of salvor on the ship  she's looking at someone through a  window and it looks like she might be  saying goodbye to hugo there's a shot at  gail swimming in something that's  submerged which is probably connected to  this other shot of her and her pod in  the water in synax the reason i'm  thinking at synax is because while she's  from there but then also the rings which  were in all the wide shots we saw from  earlier in the season when we were there  she's wearing the same clothes that she  was wearing in the shot of her swimming  earlier then there's this battle scene  on terminus rowan is there and he looks  like he's a prisoner and there's another  group of soldiers which are probably  connected to that ship from earlier  these don't look like the imperial  soldiers we've seen and then who does  that leave the only other place i could  think of would be thespis since it's  established that they hate anacrion they  could actually help terminus out if it  came down to it but based on cleon's  attacks on their planet after the star  bridge i'm not sure they're even capable  of being there and blowing stuff up plus  it looks like there's an ongoing battle  they have rowan and they look to be in  control on the ground but someone looks  like they're attacking them all of  that's interesting but it's not the  thing that stands out the most because  in the background you can see that the  vault is open so that's happening and  there appears to be some real fighting  going on in front of it it just looks  open you can't really see anything else  maybe there's some light coming out it's  kind of hard to say against that  background there's a shot of a pretty  ragged looking brother day kinda  sunburnt and covered with dust or sand  where he's grabbing a human skull this  is probably happening on his journey on  the spiral and the skull i guess is  showing you that people die when they  try to do this  and then this trailer closes out with  another shot of gail on the ship looking  at what i'm presuming is the dark star  on her trip to helicon again this looks  like harry is standing behind her he's  probably a hologram but he looks like  he's right there with her in the voice  over we hear say that we're not turning  around but it's all kind of hard to  figure out because these shots are  somehow connected to the ones where  she's on synax so some interesting stuff  and it raises quite a few questions it  looks like salvor and pharah get to the  invictus but then they come back to  terminus and then maybe the anacrions  are prisoners in that situation i don't  know what that says about the invictus  so we'll have to wait and see with that  something's going on with the vault so i  wonder if that's not the 9th or 10th  episode that we're seeing there and then  gail's all over the place it looks like  she's on her way to helicon with harry  and then what she dips out there is this  one shot where we see her getting into  the cryo pod is it all part of the plan  for her to go back to synax and if so  why doesn't look like there's anybody  there that would probably take a long  time to get there in that little cryopod  and when she arrives it does look like  she's pretty much stuck there alone and  i think that's probably a good place to  leave things i just wanted to take a  look at it all and see what you guys are  thinking so let me know in the comments  what do you think's happening in some of  these shots how do you think the  season's gonna come to an end please  like this video if you enjoyed it please  subscribe to my channel if you haven't  already and thanks for watching i'll  talk to you soon

